OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold start, with frost inland
OL,6,Fand freezing fog for some valleys in
OL,7,Fthe north. Fog will lift during the
OL,8,Fmorning, but frost may last through
OL,9,Fthe day in sheltered spots. Sunny and
OL,10,Fdry. Feeling chilly with temperatures
OL,11,Fbelow average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry night ahead with plenty
OL,14,Fof clear spells. Temperatures will
OL,15,Ffall sharply overnight beneath long
OL,16,Fclear spells as winds ease. A
OL,17,Fwidespread frost is expected,
OL,18,Fparticularly in sheltered valleys.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
