OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA frosty, sunny morning,
OL,6,Fthen becoming increasingly cloudy with
OL,7,Fa few scattered showers during the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Feeling chilly, though only
OL,9,Fa light breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fon Saturday with showers continuing,
OL,13,Ffocused over Cumbria, and a brisk,
OL,14,Fcold coastal breeze at times. Dry and
OL,15,Fcloudy on Sunday, then brighter on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
